  "notes": "{配送|はいそう} refers to delivery or shipping of goods.\n\nCOMMON EXPRESSIONS:\n- {配送|はいそう}{料|りょう}: delivery fee\n- {配送|はいそう}{先|さき}: delivery destination\n- {配送|はいそう}{状況|じょうきょう}: delivery status\n- {即日|そくじつ}{配送|はいそう}: same-day delivery\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {配達|はいたつ}: delivery (often smaller scale)\n- {発送|はっそう}: shipping (from sender's perspective)\n- {出荷|しゅっか}: shipment (business term)",
